fonts-uw-ttyp0:
fonts-uw-ttyp0: UW ttyp0 is a family of monospaced bitmap fonts.
fonts-uw-ttyp0: It supports Latin, Cyrillic, Greek, Armenian, Georgian, Hebrew,
fonts-uw-ttyp0: Tifinagh, Thai, Braille, most IPA, Powerline, box drawing,
fonts-uw-ttyp0: standard punctuation, mathematics, and various technical symbols.
fonts-uw-ttyp0: It includes about 3800 Unicode characters and supports X11 and
fonts-uw-ttyp0: Linux, FreeBSD, NetBSD, and OpenBSD consoles.
